# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile path>.dockerignore` in preference to the context root's `.dockerignore`,
# so the ignore rules for this image live beside the image that needs them.
#
# Keeping node_modules out is not an optimisation: the host's tree is a macOS/arm64 install with a
# darwin-arm64 argon2 binding in it, and copying it into the build context would shadow the linux
# install the build makes.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.storage
.smoke
.pgdata
**/*.log
.DS_Store
